en because no test drives the offline/auth/timeout fetch path — the exact fail-open guarantee the design leans on for never refusing a possibly-lagging checkout goes unverified."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Add an AC alongside AC4: 'A caused_by target with a configured remote whose one-shot refresh fails (offline/auth/timeout) is ALLOWED, not refused — proving the fail-open degrade path.'","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"uncertifiable_outcome","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"medium","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Instrument the fetch-failure degrade-to-allow branch with a log/metric so operators can see when the guard is being weakened by refresh failures.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5b","T5e"],"criteria":["T5b"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.95,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["'If the refresh fails (offline, auth, timeout) the checkout cannot be shown to hold the project's history, so the outcome is the SAME as the existing unreadable-history case — allow'","No log/metric/trace named for the failed-refresh branch"],"finding":"The fetch-failur